# Feed the Cycle (CR 601.2b, 118.3): with an empty graveyard and no Food the only way is paying {B} as well, {1}{B}{B}. Bot1 has Mox Jet and
# Mox Pearl, enough for {1}{B} but one black short: refused (Mana: short, the rest of the cost there). With Black Lotus's three black as well
# it is cast at Bot1's own Ornithopter, which is destroyed (a creature of the caster's own is a legal target); the pool then holds the two
# mana left over from the five, so exactly {1}{B}{B} was paid.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Feed the Cycle
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Feed the Cycle.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Feed the Cycle.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Feed the Cycle; Ornithopter; Black Lotus
